      «type: X»
      «description: (PLECS) Symmetrical PWM [Regular Sampling]»
      «library file: |.subckt Symmetrical-PWM-Regular m s\n.subckt Xsrc1•Triangular-Wave out\nV1 out 0 pulse Min Max (Delay-trunc(Delay*f))-1/f EffDutyCycle/f (1-EffDutyCycle)/f 0 1/f\n.param EffDutyCycle=limit(0.01,DutyCycle,0.99)\n.ends Triangular-Wave\nXsrc1 carrier Xsrc1•Triangular-wave Min=carrier_limits_min Max=carrier_limits_max f=fc DutyCycle=0.5 Delay=Tmode/fc\nB1 s 0 V=if(V(m-samp)>=V(carrier),output_values_on,output_values_off)\n¥1 N02 N03 N01 ¥ s ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ OR TTOL=TTOL\nV1 N02 0 output_values_on\nV2 N03 0 output_values_off\nB2 latch 0 V=if(sampling==1,V(carrier)<carrier_range*0.02+carrier_limits_min, if(sampling==2,V(carrier)>carrier_range*0.98+carrier_limits_min, (V(carrier)<carrier_range*0.02+carrier_limits_min)||(V(carrier)>carrier_range*0.98+carrier_limits_min) ) )\nB3 m-samp 0 V=idt(0,V(m),V(latch))\n.param Tmode=if(sampling==1,0, 0.5 )\n.param carrier_range=carrier_limits_max-carrier_limits_min\n.ends Symmetrical-PWM-Regular»
      «shorted pins: false»
